<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan stock market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan stock market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-12-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's stock market is closed on Wednesday due to a national holiday. It will reopen on Thursday.</p>
<p>On Tuesday, the index ended 3.72 points or 0.05 percent higher at 6,935.72. Turnover was an active T$46 billion.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
